{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Mountain and The Moron is a 3D Rage Platformer about a Uncle who is down on his luck, and watches a podcast telling him to &quot;Climb a mountain to become Enlightened&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/extras/Mountain_redner-removebg-preview.png?t=1746235457\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Located near the city of Uncleville, Mount Onkle, a previous attraction for the city. After years of neglect, the mountain's platforms are falling apart, making the mountain very dangerous. It has yet to claim a life, so don't be the first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/extras/Unclemaportraten.png?t=1746235457\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Uncle Dagobert, a local Uncle with no climbing experience. You will try and fail to reach the top of the mountain. You are &quot;assisted&quot; by other strange characters who watch and record you trying to reach the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>--FEATURES</strong>--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 challenging levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plenty of game modifiers that change up you experience in fun and unique ways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ragdolls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret codes that add fun Easter eggs to the game<br>Difficult platforming in risky spots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A built in timer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was made a student project :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-RasberryPi</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704970?t=1746235457","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704970?t=1746235457","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/35f89fdd228742acd4abb2a51c993b318c57231a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746235457","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/35f89fdd228742acd4abb2a51c993b318c57231a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746235457","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Mountain and The Moron is a 3D Rage Platformer about a Uncle who is down on his luck, and watches a podcast telling him to &quot;Climb a mountain to become Enlightened&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/extras/Mountain_redner-removebg-preview.png?t=1746235457\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Located near the city of Uncleville, Mount Onkle, a previous attraction for the city. After years of neglect, the mountain's platforms are falling apart, making the mountain very dangerous. It has yet to claim a life, so don't be the first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/extras/Unclemaportraten.png?t=1746235457\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Uncle Dagobert, a local Uncle with no climbing experience. You will try and fail to reach the top of the mountain. You are &quot;assisted&quot; by other strange characters who watch and record you trying to reach the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>--FEATURES</strong>--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 challenging levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plenty of game modifiers that change up you experience in fun and unique ways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ragdolls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret codes that add fun Easter eggs to the game<br>Difficult platforming in risky spots</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A built in timer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was made a student project :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-RasberryPi</p>","developers":["RasberryPi"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704970/477890f92e9d0f578beb7ffc4520450494fae16f/header.jpg?t=1746235457","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257134081,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134081/movie480.mp4?t=1746235452","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134081/movie_max.mp4?t=1746235452"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134081/94f2d1f0f04ee5c1ec4ecf400abc4218d3fccb31/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746235452","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134081/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746235452","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134081/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746235452"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257131494,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131494/movie480.mp4?t=1746235455","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131494/mov